<title>USA: NorAm Energy Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>NorAm Energy Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.29		    $0.26</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.26		     0.26</p>
<p> Net			 39,765		   34,889</p>
<p> Revs		   1,580,191		  968,078</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     137,375		  124,654</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     151,602		  124,654</p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.70		    $0.47</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.66		     0.47</p>
<p> Net			 90,858		   65,477</p>
<p> Revs		   4,788,462		2,964,679</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     131,648		  123,868</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     139,345		  123,868</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  In Q4, the company incurred $4.5 million of expenses related to the pending merger with Houston Industries Inc and $2.3 million of operating losses from the start-up of new retail marketing ventures.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
